// EXPECT: FAIL
// ERROR_CONTAINS: ANUBIS_ASSERTION_DISPROVED
// Phase 2 slice 2 — the DIRECT control for the two guarded twins.
//
// This shape always rejected. It ships beside them so the pair keeps proving what makes a finding
// real here: the direct form is REFUSED and the guarded form was ACCEPTED. If this ever flips to
// accept, the two reject fixtures next to it would still pass for the wrong reason.
fn callee(x) requires(x >= 0) { return x; }

fn app(f) { f(-1); }

fn main() { app(callee); }
